# Only these project inputs may enter the build context.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
!src/**
# Even inside src, exclude accidental local files and credentials.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.git
**/.aws
**/.ssh
**/*token*
**/*secret*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.safetensors
**/*.pt
**/*.pth
**/*.bin
